13.1 Purpose

This document records the change-management and independent-review principles applicable to the Sextant Protocol™ Orbital Resilience Research White Paper and its associated research framework.

The purpose is to maintain traceability between research propositions, software and simulation changes, validation activities, experimental evidence and subsequent releases.

The project is intended to remain open to technical challenge and independent examination.

